       bookingModes, bookingTypes, bookingStatuses, travelTypes, custDiscountOn,
       custDiscountTypes, paxTypes, paymentModes, airlineCategories, fopOptions,
       cardTypes, cabinOptions, fareTypeOptions, dsrStatuses, ssrTypes are NOT
       here any more - they load from the database table AirlineDropdownValues
       (each value with a short code, e.g. Confirmed = CON, Adult = ADT).
       Add / rename them there, not in this file. ==== -->

  <list key="currencies">
